ZjZmMDQ1M2NiZDdhMWFhZmNjMWNmM2ZhN2U4ZDc=", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Matthias", "email": "matthias.vandemeent@cofano.nl", "date": "2018-08-10T14:01:23Z"}, "committer": {"name": "Matthias", "email": "matthias.vandemeent@cofano.nl", "date": "2018-08-13T08:12:48Z"}, "message": "Add namespaces to all resources in ./charts.\n\nThis is useful for manual debugging templated resources, and consistency in (sub)-charts:\n\n- charts are rendered with .Release.Namespace in their config values, meaning it will look at resources in that namespace.\n- If you use `helm template --namespace a | kubectl apply --namespace b` the configuration will not point to an incorrect namespace: the resources are specified for the correct namespace.\n\n[opinionated]: I moved the metadata structure from any order to [name, namespace, labels/annotations]. I think that is clearer/more consistent.", "tree": {"sha": "b2f285412a4136a97a1a50658f8264e7cb31eafc", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tidalf/charts-gitlab/git/trees/b2f285412a4136a97a1a50658f8264e7cb31eafc"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tidalf/charts-gitlab/git/commits/b6e15e57913f6f0453cbd7a1aafcc1cf3fa7e8d7", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tidalf/charts-gitlab/commits/b6e15e57913f6f0453cbd7a1aafcc1cf3fa7e8d7", "html_url": "https://github.com/tidalf/charts-gitlab/commit/b6e15e57913f6f0453cbd7a1aafcc1cf3fa7e8d7", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tidalf/charts-gitlab/commits/b6e15e57913f6f0453cbd7a1aafcc1cf3fa7e8d7/comments", "author": null, "committer": null, "parents": [{"sha": "94d9b07207bff61f82ae052b4dd1946af8cf5e82", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tidalf/charts-gitlab/commits/94d9b07207bff61f82ae052b4dd1946af8cf5e82", "html_url": "https://github.com/tidalf/charts-gitlab/commit/94d9b07207bff61f82ae052b4dd1946af8cf5e82"}]}, {"sha": "dcc789fdc1b1ec49fe988ba3f941f99ab